    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39398" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθᾰλάσσ-ιος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθᾰλάσσ-ττιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Lg.</u>
			704d
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>PRev.Laws</u>
			93.5
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>HG</u>
			3.1.16
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lying</i>
			or <i>dwelling on the coast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.154
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῆς Πελοποννήσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.56
				</span></i>
			; <i>marine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				90
			</span></i>:—in <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				12
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθάλασσος</span></b>  is prob.
				f.l.</div>
